1
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:33,280
So it's the Third Prince's consort

2
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,880
No wonder you have Xiao Lang's keepsake

3
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,760
But I wonder why the consort would trouble herself

4
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:40,080
to seek me out in these remote mountains

5
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:41,760
What brings you here?

6
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,720
And why are you with the Seventh Prince?

7
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,760
I never intended to be with the Seventh Prince

8
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:49,640
But since he's here now

9
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:51,000
he might as well serve as my witness

10
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,560
Zhu Huaichen took advantage of my blindness

11
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:56,640
and had the Seventh Prince impersonate him to court me

12
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:58,360
Such humiliation

13
00:00:58,360 --> 00:00:59,520
is absolutely unforgivable

14
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:01,360
Your Highness has ties with my Li family

15
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:04,040
I beg you to contact the Li family for me

16
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,520
I demand a divorce

17
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:09,120
The Seventh Prince will testify for you

18
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:11,720
He admitted this with his own mouth

19
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:16,440
Well well, you finally found your voice

20
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:18,640
So Your Highness knew all along

21
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:21,960
You Southern Liang royals are truly birds of a feather

22
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,760
Crown Princess, this is hardly the attitude of someone asking for help

23
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:27,520
I never wanted to be any Crown Princess

24
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:29,840
Don't push people too far

25
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,760
Uncle Xiao was still thinking of you on his deathbed

26
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,520
I never thought you'd be this kind of person

27
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:37,720
Seems I asked the wrong person after all

28
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:43,360
Have you been thinking of me all this time?

29
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,360
My dear Xiao

30
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,600
The poison has already reached your heart

31
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,400
It matters not

32
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,440
Life and death are decided by heaven

33
00:02:07,080 --> 00:02:09,440
Perhaps my dear Xiao has waited too long in heaven

34
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,160
And is calling me in haste

35
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,480
What are you talking about?

36
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,800
How did the Princess get poisoned?

37
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,280
Tell her

38
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,560
You always want to protect her

39
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:23,240
Yet she's determined to pursue the truth

40
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,600
No need to hide it anymore

41
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:39,480
General Xiao was your uncle

42
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,960
You should know how he died, shouldn't you?

43
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:44,760
Ten years ago

44
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:47,760
Nanliang discovered a spy from Beijin in the palace

45
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,000
Nanliang tore up the alliance treaty

46
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,320
The two countries went to war

47
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:54,440
Uncle Xiao led soldiers to shed blood on the battlefield

48
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,160
But what if I told you

49
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,840
There was never any Beijin spy to begin with

50
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:21,920
I'm not from Beijin

51
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,720
nor a spy

52
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:32,480
How can we trust your childhood memories alone?

53
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,320
He told me about this matter

54
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,360
After my investigation

55
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:41,120
I confirmed all reports about the Beijin spy

56
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:42,800
were completely fabricated

57
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:46,160
When my investigation was discovered by the Emperor

58
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:49,320
Fearing I would expose this to the world

59
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,240
he poisoned me

60
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:55,360
That's why I hid in the mountains to live out my remaining days

61
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,120
If not for him

62
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,960
how could Xiao Lang and I have...

63
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:00,240
So this is the truth

64
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:03,400
So it was all the Southern Liang Emperor's scheme

65
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,680
He deliberately provoked war with Northern Jin

66
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:08,440
Exactly

67
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:10,680
My father is precisely the kind of man

68
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:13,120
Who would stop at nothing for his ambitions

69
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:17,040
Back then the war between two kingdoms dragged on

70
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:19,800
Causing heavy casualties in both Southern Liang and Northern Jin

71
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,360
Leaving the common people in abject misery

72
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,440
Later the two kingdoms ceased hostilities

73
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:24,920
Exchanging royal hostages

74
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,520
Zhu Huaichen went to Northern Jin to marry you

75
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,720
The two kingdoms appeared to grow closer

76
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,520
But appearances were deceiving

77
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:32,680
This was merely my father's delaying tactic

78
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:33,920
Not only that

79
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:36,600
He also sought to seize your Li family's Dragon Jade treasure

80
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:40,120
All for his selfish desires

81
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:43,480
He plunged the people into such suffering

82
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:50,120
So the Southern Liang Emperor was the mastermind behind it all

83
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:53,040
The true enemy of my Li family

84
00:04:56,960 --> 00:05:00,160
Princess, I never realized the truth was like this

85
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,720
Your Highness, do you have any way

86
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,320
to help me contact the remnants of the Li family

87
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:05,920
and help me annul this absurd marriage alliance?

88
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:09,280
Huai Jin already approached me to contact them

89
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,520
I tried

90
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,480
but times have changed

91
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:15,760
The connection Xiao Lang and I had back then is no longer valid

92
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:18,480
I'm afraid you'll have to find another way

93
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:19,880
How dare you lowly creatures

94
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:20,520
block my way!

95
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,200
Third Prince, you mustn't!

96
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,720
Third Prince!

97
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,400
You stay here

98
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:25,240
I'll handle this

99
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,840
I'll do everything in my power to protect you

100
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:36,880
By the Princess's order

101
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,280
No one is allowed to enter without permission

102
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:45,320
Don't force this prince to take action

103
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:47,560
Has the Third Prince gone mad?

104
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:49,440
Daring to cause violence in my territory!

105
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:51,880
Aunt, your nephew wishes to see you

106
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:54,760
And now I'm being stopped by these servants

107
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:56,760
Go back, I don't want to see you

108
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,040
I'll go back on one condition

109
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,400
Hand over Li Zhi'an and Zhu Huaijin

110
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:02,600
I know they're here with you

111
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,000
If you want to take them back

112
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:06,440
When you fought with her earlier

113
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:08,560
Did you consider she might come to me for help?

114
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:10,160
I've taken a liking to her

115
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,240
I'm giving her my protection

116
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:15,040
Regarding the divorce, I'll report to His Majesty

117
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:15,800
And let him decide

118
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,120
You can go back alone

119
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,400
So Li Zhi'an tricked me into coming to South Mountain

120
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:21,400
This was never about finding the Dragon Jade

121
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:23,080
But about seeking help from you, Aunt

122
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:26,000
Are you using my father's authority to pressure me now?

123
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:29,920
Then your motives for hiding Li Zhi'an here with Zhu Huaijin

124
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,360
Aren't exactly pure either

125
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:33,240
And what about you sheltering the remnants of the Li family?

126
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:34,880
What's your real purpose?

127
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:37,920
To avenge the massacre of the Li family in Beijin

128
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:41,960
Now the remnants of the Li family are branded as rebels in Beijin

129
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:43,320
If I don't protect them

130
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:45,360
Who else will avenge the Li family?

131
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:50,120
Zhu Huaichen still dares to spout such nonsense

132
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:53,560
When it was he who slaughtered my entire Li family

133
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:55,560
And turned the remaining members

134
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:57,680
Into traitors accused of colluding with the enemy

135
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:01,320
Now that we can't contact the Li army through the princess

136
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:03,680
I can't let Zhu Huaichen succeed

137
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:05,080
I must go back

138
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:15,920
Your eyes...

139
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:25,520
The Li family... completely wiped out

140
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:29,440
Zhi'an, I knew I'd find you here

141
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,240
Zhi'an

142
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:35,760
I had no idea such tragedy befell the Li family

143
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,000
So this is why...

144
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:48,160
Everything you've done

145
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:50,560
Has been to avenge the Li family

146
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:55,120
I was too preoccupied with matters of the heart before

147
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,800
But none of that matters now

148
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:59,440
As long as you can avenge the Li family

149
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:02,600
I'm willing to go back with you

150
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,480
Dragon Jade

151
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,840
I'm also willing to hand it over to you

152
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:10,080
Are you sure about this?

153
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,320
Thank you for your assistance, Princess

154
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:15,360
Please take care of yourself

155
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:17,760
Zhi An

156
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,160
Let's return to the mansion

157
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,200
Your Highness the Princess

158
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,600
Where is the Seventh Prince?

159
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:38,960
Zhu Huaijin was injured in my mountain and hasn't recovered yet

160
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,760
Let him stay here with me

161
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:02,040
Where is my aunt?

162
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:04,080
She went back with Zhu Huaichen

163
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:20,880
The Third Prince has ordered

164
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:23,160
After the Seventh Prince met with the Princess

165
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,440
He unfortunately encountered danger in the mountains

166
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,640
Fell off a cliff

167
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,440
Died without a complete corpse

168
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,120
Zhu Huaijin

169
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:33,040
You have disloyal intentions

170
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:36,040
The Third Prince won't spare you

171
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:39,320
Want to kill me?

172
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,280
With just your skills?

173
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,880
Kill!
